2 CONT
2 CONT * Wang Lichun 王力春. “Cong Jianshang shijue kan Wang Xianzhi ‘Baomu zhi' zhi wei” 從鑒賞視角看王獻之《保母志》之偽. ''Liaoning shifan daxue xuebao'' (shehui kexue ban) 34.2 (2011): 82–85.
2 CONT
