2 CONT
2 CONT Chen Shuzhong (陳叔忠) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Chen Shuhong (陳叔泓) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Chen Shuyi (陳叔毅) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Chen Shuxun (陳叔訓) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Chen Shuwu (陳叔武) 
2 CONT
