2 CONT [https://cbdb.fas.harvard.edu/cbdbapi/person.php?id=17863 '''Tang Hong''' 唐弘] [17863] Since his son #3 was Jinchang taishou, he probably held this office, but I have left employment unknown, The lineage clearly segmented with the 
2 CONC next generation, and Zi's [17864] son moved to Beihai. Based on Yong's [17866] address, this was Laizhou, Jiaoshui (modern Pingdu) county. See genealogical tables cited under ancestor, Li(2) [17851]. — [https://www.geni.com/projec
2 CONC ts/CBDB-Hartwell-collection/46406 RMH]
