1 CONT           o Consort Helian, sister of Empress Helian
1 CONT           o Consort Yujiulü, sister of Yujiulü Wuti (?????), Chilian Khan (????) of Rouran (married 434), mother of Prince Yu
1 CONT           o Consort Helai or Helan (d. 428), mother of Crown Prince Huang, posthumously honored as Empress Jing'ai
