1 CONT     * Children
1 CONT           o Tuoba Huang (???), the Crown Prince (created 432, d. 451)
1 CONT           o Tuoba Fuluo (????), the Prince of Jin (created 442, d. 447)
1 CONT           o Tuoba Han (???), initially the Prince of Qin (created 442), later the Prince of Dongping (created 452, killed by Zong Ai 452)
1 CONT           o Tuoba Tan (???), initially the Prince of Yan (created 442), later Prince Xuan of Linhuai (created and d. 452)
1 CONT           o Tuoba Jian (???), initially the Prince of Chu (created 442), later Prince Jian of Guangyang (created and d. 452)
1 CONT           o Tuoba Yu (???), initially the Prince of Wu (created 442), later Prince of Nan'an (created 452), later emperor
1 CONT           o Tuoba Xiao'er (????), died early
1 CONT           o Tuoba Mao'er (????), died early
1 CONT           o Tuoba Zhen (???), died early
